From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:26:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 090/111] Copy in the preview reads the document as it is now

The copied text came from the text runs recorded at the last redraw, so
a Copy right after Select All, or after an edit, could copy nothing or
an older version of the text. Copy now builds the text runs from the
current document with the same view code, only when it copies; the view
no longer records anything.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

